title: Atilla I — The result
view-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.endingReady(Q) && !AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.historyScene(Q); !}
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.awardEnding(Q); !}
new-page: true
go-to: cyprus_support_return if {! return !AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.endingReady(Q) || !!AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.historyScene(Q); !}

= 30 July 1974 — Atilla I: [+ cyprus_atilla1_ending +]

[? if cyprus_atilla1_ending == "Failure" : The operation has fallen short of its overall objectives. Turkey concludes Geneva I with an uneven military position and little additional bargaining strength. ?]
[? if cyprus_atilla1_ending == "Successful" : The operation has achieved the historical benchmark of overall success. Turkey concludes Geneva I with greater bargaining strength, shaped by the territory actually held and the commitments made during the ceasefire. ?]
[? if cyprus_atilla1_ending == "Massive" : The operation has achieved exceptional overall success. Turkey concludes Geneva I with substantial bargaining strength, though military gains and diplomatic costs still depend on the decisions taken. ?]

Combined Atilla I score: [+ cyprus_atilla1_score +] / [+ cyprus_atilla1_max_score +].

Diplomatic leverage gained: +[+ cyprus_atilla1_reward +]. Total leverage: [+ leverage_points +].

Position established by campaign decisions: [+ cyprus_atilla1_frontline +].

Junction: [? if cyprus_atilla1_junction == 1 : Established. ?][? if cyprus_atilla1_junction == 0 : Incomplete; coastal and airborne forces remain separated. ?]

Opposing forces: [+ cyprus_atilla1_enemy_damage +].

Airport: [+ cyprus_atilla1_access +].

Diplomatic position: [+ cyprus_atilla1_credibility +].

Geneva I concludes today. Its declaration requires that controlled areas not be extended and sets out arrangements for a UN-supervised security zone and protection of Turkish Cypriot enclaves. This closes the Atilla I chapter; local fighting and disputed positions may still continue before the next phase.

- @root: Continue.

@root
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusAtilla1.continueEnding(Q); !}
go-to: post_event
